    "methods_description": "EEG was recorded with an EMOTIV EPOC X headset (14 EEG channels, 128 Hz, hardware bandpass only) alongside continuously logged contact-quality and EEG-quality signals. All participants completed four conditions in a fixed order: eyes-open, eyes-closed, jungle soundscape, deconstruct soundscape. Liking ratings were collected for the soundscapes. Data are stored as EDF files with event markers for each segment.",
